= Chapter 1 — Reflection Questions

*The Outsiders* by S.E. Hinton

Take a few minutes to read through the questions below and write your own
thoughts. There are no right or wrong answers — this is for you to reflect on
what you have just read.

---

1.  Who is telling the story? What do we learn about the narrator in Chapter 1?

